            "text": "<h2>Pastry Pouches: A Thoughtful Gift, Right-Sized for the Moment</h2>\n<p>Sunflour Baking Company's Pastry Pouches are single large cookies from our Charlotte, NC kitchens, packaged into a compact, gift-ready format designed for the moments when you want to say something specific without overthinking the gift.</p>\n<p>Each pouch is built around one of our from-scratch cookies, baked fresh in small batches with no mixes or shortcuts. The presentation is clean and personal. Themed pouches are available for specific occasions: Bee Well for get-well sends, Celebrate for birthdays and milestones, Thank You for genuine appreciation, and You Rock for the person on your team who earned it.</p>\n<h3>Recognition Gifts That Actually Land</h3>\n<p>Pastry pouches work well as recognition gifts for employees, thank-you gifts for clients, or teacher appreciation presents. They ship nationwide and hold up well in transit, which makes them a reliable choice for remote teams or out-of-town contacts. One cookie, beautifully packaged, says more than a card.</p>\n<p>If you are looking for something with more range, our <a href=\"/collections/cookie-gifts\">cookie gift boxes</a> are a natural next step: same from-scratch quality, more cookies, more variety. The pouches are for the one-person send. The boxes are for the group or the person who deserves something bigger.</p>\n<h3>Pastry Pouch Options From Sunflour</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Four occasion themes: Bee Well, Celebrate, Thank You, You Rock</li>\n<li>One large from-scratch cookie per pouch</li>\n<li>Ships nationwide in secure, gift-ready packaging</li>\n<li>Charlotte pickup available at any of our five locations</li>\n</ul>"
